! ~/.Xresources - Tango com destaque laranja (cor do NetBSD), para uxterm e xclock
*.background:  #2e3436
*.foreground:  #eeeeec
*.cursorColor: #f57900
*.color0:  #2e3436
*.color1:  #cc0000
*.color2:  #4e9a06
*.color3:  #c4a000
*.color4:  #3465a4
*.color5:  #75507b
*.color6:  #06989a
*.color7:  #d3d7cf
*.color8:  #555753
*.color9:  #ef2929
*.color10: #8ae234
*.color11: #fce94f
*.color12: #729fcf
*.color13: #ad7fa8
*.color14: #34e2e2
*.color15: #eeeeec

UXTerm*faceName:   Cascadia Code
UXTerm*faceSize:   10
UXTerm*scrollBar:  false
UXTerm*saveLines:  4000

XClock*background: #2e3436
XClock*foreground: #eeeeec
XClock*hourColor:  #f57900
XClock*minuteColor: #f57900
XClock*majorColor: #eeeeec
XClock*minorColor: #888a85
